    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamlocked</strong> is a 3D psychological horror game where you and up to three others descend into surreal, procedurally generated dream layers filled with fear, puzzles, and unknown entities. Each session features randomized objectives, unpredictable monster behaviors, and unsettling environments that evolve as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> with recurring and random threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or 4-player online co-op</strong> gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive AI entities</strong> that stalk, hunt, and react dynamically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-solving and exploration</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource-based inventory and survival mechanics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to descend, administer the antidote, and escape alive if you can.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamlocked</strong> is a 3D psychological horror game where you and up to three others descend into surreal, procedurally generated dream layers filled with fear, puzzles, and unknown entities. Each session features randomized objectives, unpredictable monster behaviors, and unsettling environments that evolve as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> with recurring and random threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or 4-player online co-op</strong> gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive AI entities</strong> that stalk, hunt, and react dynamically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-solving and exploration</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource-based inventory and survival mechanics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to descend, administer the antidote, and escape alive if you can.</p>",
